  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sri Lanka business day event 15 May 2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">There will be a Sri Lanka Business Seminar on May 15, 2018, where participants of a trade mission from Sri Lanka can participate in individual matchmaking sessions. This project aims to establish structural long-term business relationships focussing on exports from Sri Lanka between entrepreneurs from Sri Lanka and Dutch entrepreneurs. These business relationships should result in increased exports from Sri Lanka to the Netherlands since they benefit from the renewed GSP+ status and export opportunities for Sri Lankan companies or other business relationships. That will strengthen the Sri Lankan-Dutch relations in a strategic, durable and mutually beneficiary manner.</narrative>
  </description>
